8904+ 82EE              ;      A=3 LIST full/malformed, A=4 synthetic ".."
8905+ 82EE              ;
8906+ 82EE              ;No temporary zero is written into the directory. The parser uses the stored
8907+ 82EE              ;16-bit item length as its boundary, so an item/name may cross 16K pages and
8908+ 82EE              ;may also be longer than 255 bytes.
